	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 6th level, you become able to further focus your radiant essence in battle: when hit a target using the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.FapuBZ8I4LIGOy0Q]{Brilliant Hand}, the target must make a Constitution Saving Throw against your Maneuver DC, or be blinded until the end of their next turn.</p><p>Also: if you get hit by a melee attack, you can spend 2 exertion points to attempt blinding your attacker as a reaction: they will make the same Constitution Saving Throw against your Maneuver DC, and be blinded until the end of their next turn on a failure.</p>",
